OL,3,AOpposition leader Maria Machado returns
OL,4,Afrom exile to a Venezuela reshaped by
OL,5,ATrump
OL,6,
OL,7,FDriving down roads lined with jubilant
OL,8,Fsupporters from the western state of
OL,9,FLara to the capital Caracas, Maria
OL,10,FCorina Machado's return to Venezuela
OL,11,Fcould hardly have been more different
OL,12,Fto her exit 10 months earlier.
OL,14,FColourful, loud, open and defiant, it
OL,15,Fstood in stark contrast to the way the
OL,16,FVenezuelan opposition leader slipped
OL,17,Fout of the country in the dead of night
OL,18,Fin December last year to receive the
OL,19,FNobel Peace Prize in Oslo.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
