OL,3,AOpposition leader Maria Machado returns
OL,4,Afrom exile to a Venezuela reshaped by
OL,5,ATrump
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe had been unable to make it back to
OL,8,Fher homeland until now, thwarted on
OL,9,Fseveral occasions by the Venezuelan
OL,10,Fgovernment - and by the Trump
OL,11,Fadministration, which insisted the
OL,12,F"time wasn't right" for her return.
OL,14,FNow, it appears, it is.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
